sequenceDiagram
  actor Op as Operator
  participant Env as .env.example
  participant YCR as cr.yandex
  participant S as install.sh
  participant C as compose
  participant V as Vault
  participant KC as Keycloak

  Op->>Env: fill secrets, JWT license, ROUTER_CIDR
  Op->>Op: cp .env.example .env && chmod 600
  Op->>YCR: docker login iam or oauth
  Op->>S: ./install.sh
  S->>S: require .env (no create, no login)
  S->>S: render vault-values.json if missing
  S->>C: pull
  S->>C: up pg keycloak vault
  S->>V: bootstrap-vault.sh
  S->>KC: passwords for realm JSON users
  Note over S,KC: .keycloak-passwords
  S->>C: up -d --wait
  S->>S: check Front Backend SysLog Keycloak
  Note over S: do not curl Router :30115/health/ready
